    "NotebookFactAdded": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One atomic fact extracted into the Notebook.\n\nEmitted once per fact string written during the ``extract`` phase.\n``source_query`` is the sub-query whose tool result produced this fact.\n``total_facts`` is the running total **after** this fact is added —\nso the first fact gives ``total_facts=1``.",
      "properties": {
        "fact_text": {
          "description": "The atomic fact string (e.g. 'Apple CEO is Tim Cook')",
          "maxLength": 4096,
          "title": "Fact Text",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "protocol_version": {
          "default": "1.0",
          "title": "Protocol Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "seq": {
          "description": "Per-turn monotonically-increasing sequence number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Seq",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "session_id": {
          "title": "Session Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_kind": {
          "default": "web_search",
          "enum": [
            "web_search",
            "local_deterministic"
          ],
          "title": "Source Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_query": {
          "description": "The sub-query whose tool result produced this fact",
          "title": "Source Query",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "total_facts": {
          "description": "Running total of Notebook facts after this addition",
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Total Facts",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "ts": {
          "description": "Server-side emission timestamp (UTC)",
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Ts",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "turn_id": {
          "title": "Turn Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "const": "notebook_fact_added",
          "default": "notebook_fact_added",
          "title": "Type",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "session_id",
        "turn_id",
        "seq",
        "ts",
        "fact_text",
        "source_query",
        "total_facts"
      ],
      "title": "NotebookFactAdded",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "NotebookLimitReached": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "The Notebook loop hit a configured bound and stopped early.\n\n``limit_kind`` values:\n\n``max_facts``\n    ``len(notebook) >= max_facts`` was reached before the queue\n    emptied. ``count`` is the final fact count.\n``max_iterations``\n    The loop iteration counter reached ``max_iterations`` before the\n    queue emptied. ``count`` is the number of iterations completed.\n\nThis event is always followed by\n``NotebookPhaseStart(phase=\"synthesize\")`` so synthesis still runs\non the partial Notebook.",
      "properties": {
        "count": {
          "description": "Final fact count (max_facts) or iteration count (max_iterations)",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Count",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "limit_kind": {
          "enum": [
            "max_facts",
            "max_iterations"
          ],
          "title": "Limit Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "protocol_version": {
          "default": "1.0",
          "title": "Protocol Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "seq": {
          "description": "Per-turn monotonically-increasing sequence number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Seq",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "session_id": {
          "title": "Session Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ts": {
          "description": "Server-side emission timestamp (UTC)",
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Ts",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "turn_id": {
          "title": "Turn Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "const": "notebook_limit_reached",
          "default": "notebook_limit_reached",
          "title": "Type",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "session_id",
        "turn_id",
        "seq",
        "ts",
        "limit_kind",
        "count"
      ],
      "title": "NotebookLimitReached",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "NotebookNoFacts": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "The Notebook loop ended with zero facts gathered.\n\nEmitted immediately before ``NotebookPhaseStart(phase=\"synthesize\")``\nwhen ``len(notebook.facts) == 0`` at loop exit (and the turn was not\ncancelled). Synthesis still runs on the empty Notebook and the turn\nstill terminates with ``MessageStop(stop_reason=\"complete\")`` — this\nevent is a signal, NOT an :class:`Error` and NOT a\n:class:`NotebookLimitReached`. Clients can use it to surface a\n\"we couldn't find anything\" affordance before the empty synthesis\ntext arrives.\n\n``queries_attempted`` is the number of sub-queries dequeued and sent\nto ``explore`` (including ones whose tool call errored). In the\ncurrent single-query-per-iteration loop this equals ``iterations``\n(see ``notebook.py``: ``notebook_state.iteration`` is incremented\nonce per dequeue, ratified Phase 9.7 W3-B). Both are surfaced\nindependently so future multi-query iterations don't break the\ncontract. Both are ``0`` when the planner produced an empty queue.",
      "properties": {
        "iterations": {
          "description": "Loop iterations completed before exiting the Notebook loop.",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Iterations",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "note": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxLength": 256,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "description": "Optional short human-readable hint (e.g. 'empty plan').",
          "title": "Note"
        },
        "protocol_version": {
          "default": "1.0",
          "title": "Protocol Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "queries_attempted": {
          "description": "Number of sub-queries dequeued + sent to explore (includes queries whose tool call errored).",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Queries Attempted",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "seq": {
          "description": "Per-turn monotonically-increasing sequence number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Seq",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "session_id": {
          "title": "Session Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ts": {
          "description": "Server-side emission timestamp (UTC)",
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Ts",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "turn_id": {
          "title": "Turn Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "const": "notebook_no_facts",
          "default": "notebook_no_facts",
          "title": "Type",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "session_id",
        "turn_id",
        "seq",
        "ts",
        "queries_attempted",
        "iterations"
      ],
      "title": "NotebookNoFacts",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "NotebookPhaseProgress": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Heartbeat progress event emitted during a long-running Notebook phase.\n\nUnlike :class:`NotebookPhaseStart` (one-shot at phase entry), this event\nmay be emitted multiple times within a single phase to surface elapsed\ntime and an optional human-readable note. Useful for UI progress\nindicators on slow phases (e.g., long ``explore`` tool calls or\nmulti-second ``extract`` / ``synthesize`` LLM passes).\n\n``phase`` mirrors :class:`NotebookPhaseStart` values. ``iteration``\nfollows the same indexing convention: ``0`` for one-shot\n``plan``/``synthesize``, 1-indexed for ``explore``/``extract``/\n``refine``. ``elapsed_ms`` is the time spent in the current phase so\nfar. ``note`` is an optional short descriptor (e.g., the running\nsub-query, or ``\"awaiting tool result\"``).",
      "properties": {
        "elapsed_ms": {
          "description": "Milliseconds elapsed in the current phase at emission time.",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Elapsed Ms",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "iteration": {
          "default": 0,
          "description": "Loop iteration counter. 0 for one-shot plan/synthesize; 1-indexed for explore/extract/refine (matches NotebookPhaseStart).",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Iteration",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "note": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxLength": 256,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "description": "Optional short progress note (e.g., running sub-query).",
          "title": "Note"
        },
        "phase": {
          "enum": [
            "plan",
            "explore",
            "extract",
            "refine",
            "synthesize"
          ],
          "title": "Phase",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "protocol_version": {
          "default": "1.0",
          "title": "Protocol Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "seq": {
          "description": "Per-turn monotonically-increasing sequence number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Seq",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "session_id": {
          "title": "Session Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ts": {
          "description": "Server-side emission timestamp (UTC)",
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Ts",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "turn_id": {
          "title": "Turn Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "const": "notebook_phase_progress",
          "default": "notebook_phase_progress",
          "title": "Type",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "session_id",
        "turn_id",
        "seq",
        "ts",
        "phase",
        "elapsed_ms"
      ],
      "title": "NotebookPhaseProgress",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "NotebookPhaseStart": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Emitted once per phase transition in the Notebook loop.\n\n``phase`` values:\n\n``plan``\n    LLM has decomposed the user question into Key Elements / initial\n    sub-queries. Emitted once, before the first Explore phase.\n``explore``\n    A sub-query has been dequeued and the tool call is about to run.\n    Emitted once per loop iteration (once per sub-query consumed).\n``extract``\n    Tool result received; LLM is now extracting atomic facts from the\n    raw result into the Notebook. Emitted once per loop iteration,\n    after the explore tool result lands.\n``refine``\n    At least one new follow-up query was enqueued from the extract\n    step. Emitted at most once per loop iteration (skipped if no new\n    queries were produced by this iteration).\n``synthesize``\n    Notebook is considered complete; LLM will now synthesize the final\n    answer. Followed immediately by ``MessageStart``.\n\n``iteration`` is the loop iteration counter. It is ``0`` for the\none-shot ``plan`` and ``synthesize`` phases. For ``explore``/``extract``/\n``refine`` it is ``1``-indexed (i.e., the first dequeued sub-query\nyields ``iteration=1``) — matches the impl's increment-before-yield\npattern in ``notebook.py`` (Wave 4 reconcile R-F2). Pydantic accepts\n``ge=0`` to cover both shapes.",
      "properties": {
        "iteration": {
          "default": 0,
          "description": "Loop iteration counter. 0 for one-shot plan/synthesize; 1-indexed for explore/extract/refine (Wave 4 R-F2).",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Iteration",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "phase": {
          "enum": [
            "plan",
            "explore",
            "extract",
            "refine",
            "synthesize"
          ],
          "title": "Phase",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "protocol_version": {
          "default": "1.0",
          "title": "Protocol Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "seq": {
          "description": "Per-turn monotonically-increasing sequence number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Seq",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "session_id": {
          "title": "Session Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ts": {
          "description": "Server-side emission timestamp (UTC)",
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Ts",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "turn_id": {
          "title": "Turn Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "const": "notebook_phase_start",
          "default": "notebook_phase_start",
          "title": "Type",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "session_id",
        "turn_id",
        "seq",
        "ts",
        "phase"
      ],
      "title": "NotebookPhaseStart",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "NotebookQueryAdded": {
